Have had success playing MP3s using kmp3.   There is however a  continous
popping about every 500-750 ms.  This popping disappears after clicking
pause/play but returns when the next song begins.  Card sounds great 
without popping.    Have not been successful at ditigal I/O or playing CDs yet.
Haven't had a chance to try the analog sampling or MIDI yet..  This is a great
card and will be even greater for us when all the bugs are worked out in the
drivers.

350Mhz AMD K6-II, 128MB,  2.0.36

